<section id="work" aria-labelledby="h-work"><div class="wrap">
  <h2 id="h-work">Case Studies</h2>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="tag">Sourcing Strategy · Reliance Industries</div>
    <h3>Cutting material lead times by 15% through local supplier development</h3>
    <p class="muted">An import-dependent supply base was creating long, volatile lead times during pilot production, limiting how quickly the team could iterate.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Mapped the existing supply base and identified the categories where domestic alternatives were commercially viable.</li>
      <li>Sourced, evaluated and onboarded 20 domestic suppliers, running technical and commercial assessment on each.</li>
      <li>Restructured RFQs alongside external consultants to make bids comparable on a like-for-like basis.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="result"><b>Result:</b> ~15% reduction in material lead times and materially improved supplier responsiveness during pilot phases.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="tag">Commercial Analysis · Reliance Industries</div>
    <h3>Turning 212 vendor proposals into a decision leadership could actually make</h3>
    <p class="muted">Supplier selection for a large-scale manufacturing programme was slowed by inconsistent proposal formats and a 20-day review preparation cycle.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Designed standardised evaluation and reporting templates covering technical, commercial and risk criteria.</li>
      <li>Analysed 212+ domestic and international proposals, synthesising each into an executive-ready recommendation.</li>
      <li>Managed end-to-end commercial engagement from NDA negotiation through product evaluation to quality-testing sign-off.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="result"><b>Result:</b> Review preparation time cut from 20 days to roughly 7, with recommendations directly informing strategic supplier selection.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="tag">Operations &amp; Logistics · Reliance Industries</div>
    <h3>Building visibility across 100+ suppliers and 20 live shipments</h3>
    <p class="muted">Shipment and vendor information sat in disconnected spreadsheets across teams, making status questions expensive to answer and risks slow to surface.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Built and maintained a centralised vendor and shipment database spanning 100+ suppliers and 3 ports.</li>
      <li>Coordinated shipments end to end — tonnage validation, cargo readiness, FOB dates, container utilisation and vessel bookings.</li>
      <li>Chaired weekly contractor reviews, tracking milestones and escalating dependency risks before they hit downstream teams.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="result"><b>Result:</b> ~6–7 hours per week of manual tracking eliminated, and a ~4-week reduction in document-clearance cycle time on the solar programme.</div>
  </div>
</div></section>

